ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I'll admit I doubted myself for a second when I saw methods being registered as a property in the previous PR. Had to search online to make sure I wasn't going crazy thinking that methods aren't properties. \nI'd more than welcome a style PR to fix this naming \"quirk\". ","created_at":"2026-08-24T12:35:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T12:35:59Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122751#discussion_r3843488795","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122751","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3843488795"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122751#discussion_r3843488795"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122751"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3843488795/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":54,"original_line":54,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3842967403,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":1,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3844782867","pull_request_review_id":5009413771,"id":3844782867,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7lKrsT","diff_hunk":"@@ -979,13 +966,21 @@ void ClassDB::get_method_list(const StringName &p_class, List<MethodInfo> *p_met\n \tLocker::Lock lock(Locker::STATE_READ);\n \n \tClassInfo *type = classes.getptr(p_class);\n-\tfor (const KeyValue<StringName, const MethodBind *> &kv : type->gdtype->get_method_map(p_no_inheritance)) {","path":"core/object/class_db.cpp","commit_id":"7bdffaec462dd37d9ed211ba1f9ba